## Architecture Overview

```
KITTI Sequence
     │
     ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│  1. Data Loader     │  Reads images, calibration K, distortion, ground truth poses
└─────────────────────┘
     │
     ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│  2. Preprocessor    │  Undistort frames using K and distortion coefficients (cv2.undistort)
└─────────────────────┘
     │
     ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│  3. Feature Frontend│  ORB detection → LK Optical Flow tracking across frames
└─────────────────────┘
     │
     ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│  4. Motion Estimator│  Essential Matrix (5-pt + RANSAC) → SVD pose recovery (R, t)
└─────────────────────┘
     │
     ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│  5. Local Map       │  Triangulation → PnP refinement against 3D landmarks
└─────────────────────┘
     │
     ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│  6. Pose Graph      │  Build graph: nodes = SE3 poses, edges = odometry constraints
└─────────────────────┘
     │
     ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│  7. Loop Closure    │  BoW image retrieval → geometric verification → new graph edge
└─────────────────────┘
     │
     ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│  8. Graph Optimizer │  g2o / graphslam / scipy Gauss-Newton / LM optimization
└─────────────────────┘
     │
     ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│  9. Evaluator       │  ATE + RPE via `evo` library against KITTI ground truth
└─────────────────────┘
     │
     ▼
┌─────────────────────┐
│ 10. Visualizer      │  Open3D real-time 3D trajectory + point cloud + GT overlay
└─────────────────────┘
```

